HST Office: Vietnamese strings of the Slides transitions gallery.

The gallery's accessible name and the tooltips of its buttons (hsttransitiongallery.ui) and the label of
.uno:HstApplyTransition (hst-slides-transition-gallery.patch), inserted beside the existing slide
transition strings rather than at the end of the files.

- translations/source/vi/sd/messages.po, translations/source/vi/officecfg/.../UI.po.

